{"channelId":"UCvmtCJBK2PTuy-mFfpoXy5Q","row":["Heather Gosse",5220,"I'm Heather — I paint with acrylics and I'm building an art business one canvas (and one festival) at a time. This channel is my process: the paintings, the wins and the messes of figuring out the business side, and the parts of my life that shape the work — including the rave scene, which is basically where I go to plug back into the energy I try to put into every piece.\n\nMy mission is simple: spread positive energy through art and help raise the vibration of the collective consciousness — one painting, one video, one drop at a time.\n\nNew long form videos when I can and new short form videos more often. Shop original paintings and prints :)","theheathergosse@gmail.com",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvmtCJBK2PTuy-mFfpoXy5Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvmtCJBK2PTuy-mFfpoXy5Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:29.412Z","channelId":"UCvmtCJBK2PTuy-mFfpoXy5Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0a5cdcefc364c892d1bb29c7b38c9939d3f50fe58dba6de715762e5fc1801309","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"0c3ce9bcf9adf7bcbe28f977d0e001363596df5373a404024b54711422a1e315"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvmtCJBK2PTuy-mFfpoXy5Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":5220,"raw":"5.22K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvmtCJBK2PTuy-mFfpoXy5Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:29.412Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"theheathergosse@gmail.com","purpose":"business","ownerRole":"creator_or_team","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hsNe_nFgRjc"],"evidenceIds":["video-contact:3f63fec3e3cee811be2f7e24"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:34:18.631Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"🤝 For business enquiries email: theheathergosse@gmail.com","raw":"theheathergosse@gmail.com